<p>${S("Vercel Hobby (zdarma) sta\u010D\xED pro osobn\xED pou\u017Eit\xED; pro firemn\xED pou\u017Eit\xED vy\u017Eaduje Vercel tarif Pro, nebo pou\u017Eijte Docker.","Vercel Hobby (free) is fine for personal use; for company use Vercel requires the Pro plan, or use Docker.")}</p>
